  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the following circuit, the correct relation between output <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>Y</mi></mfenced></math> and inputs <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> will be</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9d2a5440-9828-4d56-a04e-9f177f90229c-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 185px;\" /></p>",
